    "justification_en": "Official WKF Rules (WKF 2026.01, Art. 10.4.4, p. 28 / Art. 10.4.3, p. 28): Official Rule Text: \"The Referee must continue to observe the injured Athlete... reveal any efforts by the Athlete to aggravate a slight injury for tactical advantage. An obvious display of exaggeration will receive a HANSOKU CHUI.\". Analysis: An athlete who sustains a genuine injury but theatrically exaggerates or magnifies its effects to gain tactical advantage or induce penalties against the opponent is subject to penalty for exaggeration.",
