    "justification_en": "Official WKF Rules (WKF 2026.01, Art. 7.9, p. 20 / Art. 12.2.7, p. 34): Official Rule Text: \"The Referee will thereafter raise their arm and declare the winner, AO (AKA) NO KACHI, and if necessary, by this action, break the tie.\". Analysis: In a 2–2 split among corner judges during HANTEI, the Referee casts the deciding vote, thereby breaking the tie when declaring the winner. WKF KUMITE REFEREE & JUDGE EXAMINATION GUIDE | QUESTIONS 51–100WKF RULES VERSION 2026.01 Official True/False Legal Analysis & Verbatim Rulebook CitationsPage 9",
